// This workspace wires the root module and the cmd/kukebuild module together
// for editor / gopls cross-module navigation during local dev (issue #655).
//
// Do NOT build or test through the workspace: kukebuild's BuildKit closure and
// the root module's graph are deliberately kept apart (they have clashed
// before, e.g. the monolithic vs. split google.golang.org/genproto ambiguous
// import), and a workspace-union build re-couples them — the very coupling this
// split removes. Keep this `go` line equal to both modules' `go` directive.
// Build and test each module on its own (GOWORK=off), which is what `make` and
// CI do and what the Dockerfile builder (no go.work) sees.
go 1.26.6

use (
	.
	./cmd/kukebuild
)
